{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-51"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815332-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"승진하고 세 번째 날을 맞이했다! 어쩐 일인지 당신은 이미 지부 건물 공터의 주인이 되어 있었다!","talkId":403815332,"textHash":"14501853920288377874","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/talk-403815332","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e981fd060b10d13f","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815333-line"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815333-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"직접 만든 「P-35」 배지를 가슴팍에 달았다. 이제 모두에게 당신의 업적을 보일 차례가 왔단 생각이 들었다!","talkId":403815333,"textHash":"1976807620793175065","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/talk-403815333","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e981fd060b10d13f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-3649853339821124735-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"당신은 텅 빈 주변을 바라본다","talkId":null,"textHash":"3649853339821124735","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/text-3649853339821124735","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c86ed39a5926e252","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-12984480696839606514-effect"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-12984480696839606514-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"무한한 권력을 얻었다! 하지만 양손은 텅 비고 말았다. 모든 우주 조각을 소실하고 모든 축복을 강화한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12984480696839606514","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/text-12984480696839606514","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c86ed39a5926e252","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-3649853339821124735-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-17638440772633073185-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"바로 「P-48」 타라반•킨을 도발한다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"17638440772633073185","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/text-17638440772633073185","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"dc77a0a87e9e0627","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-12912424501481845193-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"바로 「P-48」 흉터 부인을 도발한다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"12912424501481845193","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/text-12912424501481845193","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c0def498a74eb703","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815338-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그 어떤 거물도 당신에게 응답하지 않았다! 문뜩 현실을 깨달은 당신은 담배를 한 모금 하곤 텅 빈 거리를 따라 뒤로 걸었다…. 그러다 시멘트 기둥에 등을 기댔을 때, 당신의 얼굴엔 근심과 실망감이 떠올라있었다","talkId":403815338,"textHash":"8598083536907656501","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/talk-403815338","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"bda1eb8f601f3058","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815339-line"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815339-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그렇다, 이건 예상치 못한 결말이었다. 대체 어디서부터 잘못된 걸까? 인생을 처음부터 다시 하고 싶단 생각이 들었다. 돌아간다면… 다른 길을 선택할 수 있지 않을까?","talkId":403815339,"textHash":"1401026633390502059","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/talk-403815339","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"bda1eb8f601f3058","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815340-line"],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815340-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-51","missionId":"event-rogue-51","mission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","scene":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"…그렇게 정신을 잃었다. 욕망에 눈이 먼 직원들은 *암암리에 처리*되어 컴퍼니 비밀 회의실 벽에 초상화로 걸려왔던 것이었다","talkId":403815340,"textHash":"15356154421372223034","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:51/talk-403815340","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"bda1eb8f601f3058","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"星际和平公司「升职记」（其四）","bwikiRevision":71958,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10398","bwikiMission":"스타피스 컴퍼니 「승진기」 (4)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815332-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815333-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-3649853339821124735-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-12984480696839606514-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-17638440772633073185-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-text-12912424501481845193-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815338-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815339-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-51-talk-403815340-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":9,"reviewRows":0,"segments":5,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}